{"id":"480aad3d687fd5b3","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-prop-transitive.md","title":"Transitivity Properties","display":"prop-transitive — Transitivity Properties","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-transitive","aliases":["58-prop-transitive"],"display":"prop-transitive — Transitivity Properties","depends_on":["[[58-df-transitive-set]]","[[../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-transitive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-transitive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-transitive — Transitivity Properties"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"58-df-transitive-set\">58-df-transitive-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8c8abfb908cc9a24\" href=\"?note=8c8abfb908cc9a24\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md\">../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in V\">\\(X,Y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"58-df-transitive-set\">58-df-transitive-set</a> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TC}\">\\(\\operatorname{TC}\\)</span> is the transitive-closure term from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8c8abfb908cc9a24\" href=\"?note=8c8abfb908cc9a24\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md\">../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}transitive} \\vdash X\\subseteq Y\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(Y)\\to\\operatorname{TC}(X)\\subseteq Y\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}transitive} \\vdash X\\subseteq Y\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(Y)\\to\\operatorname{TC}(X)\\subseteq Y\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The transitive closure of a set is the smallest transitive set containing it.</li>\n<li>Every ordinal is transitive.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-transitive-set","status":"resolved","id":"c14ba496c480dcd6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-transitive-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md","status":"resolved","id":"8c8abfb908cc9a24","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-transitive-set","status":"resolved","id":"c14ba496c480dcd6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S$ is from [[58-df-transitive-set]] and $\\operatorname{TC}$ is the transitive-closure term from [[../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md","status":"resolved","id":"8c8abfb908cc9a24","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S$ is from [[58-df-transitive-set]] and $\\operatorname{TC}$ is the transitive-closure term from [[../batch10/58-df-transitive-closure.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}transitive} \\vdash X\\subseteq Y\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(Y)\\to\\operatorname{TC}(X)\\subseteq Y","display":true}],"bytes":792,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4003","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-prop-transitive.md|58-prop-transitive]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["c14ba496c480dcd6","8c8abfb908cc9a24"]}